{"id":259,"date":"2020-05-13T16:59:03","date_gmt":"2020-05-13T13:59:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/artielektrik.net\/?p=259"},"modified":"2020-05-13T17:05:01","modified_gmt":"2020-05-13T14:05:01","slug":"elektrik-trafosu-montaji-ve-bakimi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/artielektrik.net\/elektrik-trafosu-montaji-ve-bakimi\/","title":{"rendered":"Elektrik Trafosu Montaj\u0131 ve Bak\u0131m\u0131"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>M\u00fc\u015fterilerimizin iste\u011fi do\u011frultusunda sahadaki mevcut transformat\u00f6rlerin i\u015fletme ve bak\u0131m talimatlar\u0131na uygun \u015fekilde, gerekli t\u00fcm bak\u0131m ve saha i\u015flemlerini periyodik olarak ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirmekteyiz.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Yeni bir trafoya ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z varsa, trafo i\u00e7in gerekli dire\u011fin dikilmesinden gerekli kablolar\u0131n \u00e7ekilmesinden ve trafonun dire\u011fin \u00fcst\u00fcne tak\u0131larak gerekli t\u00fcm ba\u011flant\u0131 kontrol ve testlerin yap\u0131m\u0131na kadar gerekli olan t\u00fcm hizmetleri Art\u0131 Elektrik olarak sunmaktay\u0131z.<br>Bak\u0131mda sahada verdi\u011fimiz hizmetler a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki gibidir;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>&gt; Montaj ve Devreye Alma<br><br>B\u00fcy\u00fck g\u00fc\u00e7 transformat\u00f6rlerinin a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131 ve \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcleri montaj ve nakliye a\u00e7\u0131s\u0131ndan \u00e7ok \u00f6zenli bir planlama gerektirir.<br><br>Yeni kurulan transformat\u00f6r i\u00e7in sahada verdi\u011fimiz hizmetler a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki gibidir;<br><br>&gt;&nbsp;\u0130zolasyon direnci testi (Megger)<br>&gt;&nbsp;\u00c7evirme Oran\u0131 Testi<br>&gt;&nbsp;Sarg\u0131 Direnci Testi<br>&gt;&nbsp;Dobble AC izolasyon testi<br>&gt;&nbsp;SFRA<br>&gt;&nbsp;Bas\u0131n\u00e7 alt\u0131nda s\u0131zd\u0131rmazl\u0131k testi<br>&gt;&nbsp;Transformat\u00f6r ya\u011f\u0131n\u0131n vakum alt\u0131nda tasfiye edilerek bas\u0131lmas\u0131<br>&gt;&nbsp;Ya\u011f\u0131n Dielektrik Dayan\u0131m Testi<br>&gt;&nbsp;Ya\u011f\u0131n Power Fakt\u00f6r\u00fc<br>&gt;&nbsp;Ya\u011fdaki su miktar\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm\u00fc<br>&gt;&nbsp;Ya\u011f\u0131n gaz analizi<br>&gt;&nbsp;Koruma elemanlar\u0131n\u0131n fonksiyonel testleri<br>&gt;&nbsp;Transformat\u00f6r\u00fcn genel kontrol\u00fc<br>&gt;&nbsp;Ya\u011f ka\u00e7aklar\u0131n\u0131n giderilmesi ve kal\u0131c\u0131 \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcmler getirilmesi<br>&gt;&nbsp;Al\u00e7ak gerilim ve y\u00fcksek gerilim izolat\u00f6rlerinin bak\u0131m\u0131 ve ba\u011flant\u0131 noktalar\u0131n\u0131n iyile\u015ftirilmesi, gerekti\u011finde izolat\u00f6rlerin yenileri ile de\u011fi\u015ftirilmesi<br>&gt;&nbsp;Koruma elemanlar\u0131n\u0131n fonksiyonel testleri ve ar\u0131zal\u0131 olan elemanlar\u0131n modernize edilmi\u015f koruma elemanlar\u0131 ile de\u011fi\u015ftirilmesi<br>&gt;&nbsp;Transformat\u00f6r\u00fcn elektriksel testleri<br>&gt;&nbsp;Transformat\u00f6r ya\u011f\u0131ndan numune al\u0131nmas\u0131 ve ya\u011f\u0131n analizi<br>&gt;&nbsp;Transformat\u00f6r ya\u011f\u0131n\u0131n modernize edilmi\u015f sistemlerle sahada tasfiyesi<br>&gt;&nbsp;Transformat\u00f6r ya\u011f\u0131n\u0131n de\u011fi\u015ftirilmesi<br>&gt;&nbsp;Gerekli contalar\u0131n de\u011fi\u015ftirilmesi<br>&gt;&nbsp;Mevcut kumanda panosunun modernizasyonu veya de\u011fi\u015ftirilmesi<br>&gt;&nbsp;So\u011futma sisteminin yenilenmesi ve kapasitesinin artt\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131<br>&gt;&nbsp;Otomatik voltaj reg\u00fclat\u00f6r\u00fc panosu temini ve mevcut sisteme adaptasyonu<br>&gt;&nbsp;Paralel \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma panosu temini ve trafolar\u0131n paralel \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131<br>&gt;&nbsp;Y\u00fckte kademe de\u011fi\u015ftirici bak\u0131m\u0131.<br>&gt;&nbsp;Online izleme mod\u00fcllerinin trafoya adaptasyonu<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\